  pureDraw: ["完全随机（不参考成绩）","Fully random (ignore results)","完全ランダム（成績を参照しない）","完全隨機（唔參考成績）","완전 무작위(기록 무시)","Aléatoire complet (sans les résultats)","Totalmente aleatorio (sin registros)"],
  avoidSchool: ["首轮同校避战（学校队尽量不首轮相遇；自由人队不参与）","Avoid same-school first-round matches where possible (independent teams excluded)","初戦の同校対戦を可能な限り回避（混成チームは対象外）","盡量避免同校隊首輪碰頭（自由人隊唔計）","같은 학교 팀의 1회전 대결을 가능한 한 피함(혼성 팀 제외)","Éviter si possible les duels du même établissement au premier tour (hors indépendants)","Evitar equipos del mismo centro en primera ronda cuando sea posible (excepto independientes)"],
